  {
    "hotel_id": "65737852",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/zedwell-capsules-piccadilly/hotel/all/london-gb.html",
    "name": "Zedwell Capsule Hotel Piccadilly Circus",
    "detail": "It's a bit expensive for a capsule hotel, but the location in the middle of Soho is fantastic. The capsule serves as my space and luggage storage, so those with suitcases will likely be assigned to the 2nd or 3rd floor, which might be inconvenient. However, as a backpacker, it was convenient for me to keep my things inside the capsule, so that was alright. There are plenty of shower rooms and toilets, which is good, but I wish there were hairdryers available. The ventilation system can be individually adjusted in each capsule, and even in October, it took about an hour for medium-length hair to air dry. You have to pay for towels and luggage storage, but there are many luggage storage places nearby, so I think it would be better to use them. The cost of storing one bag here is the same as the price for storing two bags at a nearby luggage storage facility. The security checks the keys 24 hours a day when entering and exiting the shared areas of the accommodation, which is nice. I definitely recommend this for those traveling alone in London!",
